      "evidence_sha256": "a9e4ec2b801c36f128dd2f7e80d10a75401dd59b7f0dccb755d49b94bd01ce24",
      "assessment": "R5 G3 correctly identifies its own r01 late-increase branch and its actual late-down last action, showing progress against branch-label confusion. It reports current delivery/geometry unavailable. However it continues calling every non-early window inert and treats index1 6-to5 as if the risk were the previously measured 5-to4 step.",
      "decision_update": "[6,6,5,5] enters the archived final selection, while [6,5,4,5] does not; neither is sampled. Both are conditional component reversions, but expected effects must be scoped to the actual levels rather than all downward changes.",
      "counterexample_or_limitation": "Its falsifier demands a response comparable to the earlier 0.054 Mean gain or broad strata. There is no evidence that smaller concentrated responses are irrelevant. The budget is exhausted and this record cannot justify an extra round.",
